Sun Oct 18 17:18:09 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.9.0 (upstream tag v0.9.0, 2026-10-18):
  * Media: preserve individual linked-clip selections through deletion;
    keep Unicode prefixes in image-sequence filenames; fix UTF-8 slice
    panics in interchange file URLs.
  * Export: renderer-pool deadlock fixed; follow stored media paths only
    on this computer or the project share.
  * Re-vendored (update=false kept for --locked, no in-tree vendor/ upstream;
    respect-lockfile true); license re-derived over shipped targets, no new
    copyleft (new crate craft-docpath 0.1.0, MIT OR Apache-2.0), tag stands;
    no new system deps.

