Thu Oct 15 04:51:37 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.0 (stable tag v0.8.0, 2026-10-14,
  draft=false prerelease=false):
  * Import: raw ADTS .aac, MP1 audio from Matroska, Radiance HDR
    stills, YUV4MPEG2 video, YCbCr TIFF, PXR24 OpenEXR
  * Export: 32-bit integer and float audio, caption sidecars clipped
    to range, 32-bit FLAC round-trips
  * Harden demuxers against malformed files (no CVE assigned):
    MPEG-1 program-stream cut no longer panics, H.264 malformed
    PPS validated, MPEG-TS bounds-checked with capped allocations
  * Timeline and UI fixes: transitions travel with clips, eyedropper
    picks from Program monitor, Linux file dialogs, Korean catalog
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list
- Re-vendored with update=false against the new Cargo.lock; audit
  clean, licence set unchanged, Legal-Review-Notice still current
- filmcraft-no-brand-assets.patch still applies unchanged

